{"fileHash":"sha256:c074bb1f7c1fd38ec4a5287867088fb3ebb87b8efba0d1b17ef2d61e4cee99cd","sections":{"preamble-pf24021f6":{"contentHash":"sha256:f24021f69bc02dccfe7de23d1a4c81ba2e86f204667cc3d0009a1cbcd7858f6c","proseHash":"sha256:f24021f69bc02dccfe7de23d1a4c81ba2e86f204667cc3d0009a1cbcd7858f6c","translation":"---\ntitle: \"Slack\"\ndescription: \"将 Slack 与 Adapty 集成，实时接收订阅事件通知。\"\nmetadataTitle: \"Slack 与 Adapty 集成 | Adapty 文档\"\n---\n\nimport AccessLevelUpdatedEventFeed from '@site/src/components/reusable/AccessLevelUpdatedEventFeed.mdx';\n\nimport Zoom from 'react-medium-image-zoom';\nimport 'react-medium-image-zoom/dist/styles.css';\n\n[Slack](https://slack.com/) 是一款职场即时通讯和效率协作平台，想必大家已经耳熟能详。\n"},"preamble-p8dac0969":{"contentHash":"sha256:8dac096941681573e5c00b3318b4c481ab0c5ef8dcf791252073abe636707254","proseHash":"sha256:8dac096941681573e5c00b3318b4c481ab0c5ef8dcf791252073abe636707254","translation":"通过此集成，每当 Adapty 追踪到一笔收入事件时，你都会在 Slack 中收到通知。如果你希望第一时间感受到每一次 MRR 增长的喜悦，或者想要及时掌握试用取消、付款问题、退款等动态，这项功能会非常实用。\n"},"h2-how-to-set-up-slack-integration":{"contentHash":"sha256:45cdb8f0955f6e9e4e33092f6d79898bfbb937867ef744380486af30a20bd41f","proseHash":"sha256:45cdb8f0955f6e9e4e33092f6d79898bfbb937867ef744380486af30a20bd41f","translation":"## 如何设置 Slack 集成 \\{#how-to-set-up-slack-integration\\}\n\n您需要：\n\n- 在您的 Slack 工作区中创建一个应用\n- 授予其发送消息的权限\n- 然后在 [Integrations → Slack](https://app.adapty.io/integrations/slack) 中向 Adapty 提供必要信息。\n"},"h3-1-create-an-app-in-slack-pb1de4cc7":{"contentHash":"sha256:b1de4cc75ffecb0a3b629bccedf48f1ab76c35fc198057be619f3dd10bde7e17","proseHash":"sha256:b1de4cc75ffecb0a3b629bccedf48f1ab76c35fc198057be619f3dd10bde7e17","translation":"### 1\\. 在 Slack 中创建应用 \\{#create-an-app-in-slack\\}\n\n1. 前往 [Slack API 看板](https://api.slack.com/apps) 并按如下方式创建应用：\n\n<Zoom>\n  <img src=\"/assets/shared/img/f43aedc-CleanShot_2024-01-04_at_18.27.412x.webp\"\n  style={{\n    border: 'none', /* border width and color */\n    width: '700px', /* image width */\n    display: 'block', /* for alignment */\n    margin: '0 auto' /* center alignment */\n  }}\n/>\n</Zoom>\n"},"h3-1-create-an-app-in-slack-p91985ca0":{"contentHash":"sha256:91985ca0ee8f295639c9968bc74e78a3b0d515889fd9d5bcf9e7cba266f70ee6","proseHash":"sha256:91985ca0ee8f295639c9968bc74e78a3b0d515889fd9d5bcf9e7cba266f70ee6","translation":"<Zoom>\n  <img src=\"/assets/shared/img/08fa9e6-CleanShot_2024-01-04_at_18.28.142x.webp\"\n  style={{\n    border: 'none', /* border width and color */\n    width: '700px', /* image width */\n    display: 'block', /* for alignment */\n    margin: '0 auto' /* center alignment */\n  }}\n/>\n</Zoom>\n\n2. 为其命名（例如 `Adapty`），并将其添加到你的工作区：\n"},"h3-1-create-an-app-in-slack-p1bbd3e5b":{"contentHash":"sha256:1bbd3e5b2ec9cf4b5f950451cafcd51520136e7f67c88d998acadb2a30ba6a34","proseHash":"sha256:1bbd3e5b2ec9cf4b5f950451cafcd51520136e7f67c88d998acadb2a30ba6a34","translation":"<Zoom>\n  <img src=\"/assets/shared/img/5002bb1-CleanShot_2024-01-04_at_18.29.132x.webp\"\n  style={{\n    border: 'none', /* border width and color */\n    width: '700px', /* image width */\n    display: 'block', /* for alignment */\n    margin: '0 auto' /* center alignment */\n  }}\n/>\n</Zoom>\n"},"h3-2-give-permission-to-post-and-get-a-token-for-your-app-pc6f289e6":{"contentHash":"sha256:c6f289e69a79de385f2956d106c155a61aae54ac33bb3fd55ba45ca1509a6ba0","proseHash":"sha256:c6f289e69a79de385f2956d106c155a61aae54ac33bb3fd55ba45ca1509a6ba0","translation":"### 2\\. 授予权限并获取应用的 Token \\{#give-permission-to-post-and-get-a-token-for-your-app\\}\n\n你将被重定向到 Slack 中你的应用页面。\n\n1. 向下滚动并点击 **Permissions**：\n\n<Zoom>\n  <img src=\"/assets/shared/img/9750451-CleanShot_2024-01-04_at_18.48.072x.webp\"\n  style={{\n    border: 'none', /* border width and color */\n    width: '700px', /* image width */\n    display: 'block', /* for alignment */\n    margin: '0 auto' /* center alignment */\n  }}\n/>\n</Zoom>\n\n2. 重定向后，向下滚动至 **Scopes**，然后点击 **Add an OAuth Scope**：\n"},"h3-2-give-permission-to-post-and-get-a-token-for-your-app-p9fc9048e":{"contentHash":"sha256:9fc9048efcd823536d0f27575b65daa97954700e64de67db226a42616f4aa483","proseHash":"sha256:9fc9048efcd823536d0f27575b65daa97954700e64de67db226a42616f4aa483","translation":"<Zoom>\n  <img src=\"/assets/shared/img/db5b5f4-CleanShot_2024-01-04_at_18.50.262x.webp\"\n  style={{\n    border: 'none', /* border width and color */\n    width: '700px', /* image width */\n    display: 'block', /* for alignment */\n    margin: '0 auto' /* center alignment */\n  }}\n/>\n</Zoom>\n\n3. 授予 `chat:write`、`chat:write.public` 和 `chat:write.customize` 权限。这些权限用于在你的频道中发布消息并自定义消息内容：\n"},"h3-2-give-permission-to-post-and-get-a-token-for-your-app-p6b0245db":{"contentHash":"sha256:6b0245db11d182b32f47144a1038650ee5277e0d9c5e782aeec0e404e842834b","proseHash":"sha256:6b0245db11d182b32f47144a1038650ee5277e0d9c5e782aeec0e404e842834b","translation":"<Zoom>\n  <img src=\"/assets/shared/img/d97ccb9-CleanShot_2024-01-04_at_18.51.572x.webp\"\n  style={{\n    border: 'none', /* border width and color */\n    width: '700px', /* image width */\n    display: 'block', /* for alignment */\n    margin: '0 auto' /* center alignment */\n  }}\n/>\n</Zoom>\n\n4. 滚动回页面顶部，点击 **Install to Workspace**：\n"},"h3-2-give-permission-to-post-and-get-a-token-for-your-app-pbb494652":{"contentHash":"sha256:bb49465217c1b210d2c3a51109fbbbee2e6d1bde329308db54fe58718d4cc605","proseHash":"sha256:bb49465217c1b210d2c3a51109fbbbee2e6d1bde329308db54fe58718d4cc605","translation":"<Zoom>\n  <img src=\"/assets/shared/img/14608e3-CleanShot_2024-01-04_at_19.17.58.webp\"\n  style={{\n    border: 'none', /* border width and color */\n    width: '700px', /* image width */\n    display: 'block', /* for alignment */\n    margin: '0 auto' /* center alignment */\n  }}\n/>\n</Zoom>\n\n5. 点击此处的 **Allow**：\n\n<Zoom>\n  <img src=\"/assets/shared/img/143967e-CleanShot_2024-01-04_at_18.53.292x.webp\"\n  style={{\n    border: 'none', /* border width and color */\n    width: '700px', /* image width */\n    display: 'block', /* for alignment */\n    margin: '0 auto' /* center alignment */\n  }}\n/>\n</Zoom>\n"},"h3-2-give-permission-to-post-and-get-a-token-for-your-app-pd15386aa":{"contentHash":"sha256:d15386aaa7068eae527cd0782bd298faf6832db0ff555a55176d83ecff9b6032","proseHash":"sha256:d15386aaa7068eae527cd0782bd298faf6832db0ff555a55176d83ecff9b6032","translation":"完成后，您将被重定向到同一页面，但此时会显示一个 OAuth Token（`xoxb-...`）。这正是完成设置所需的内容：\n\n<Zoom>\n  <img src=\"/assets/shared/img/59b33ee-CleanShot_2024-01-04_at_18.55.222x.webp\"\n  style={{\n    border: 'none', /* border width and color */\n    width: '700px', /* image width */\n    display: 'block', /* for alignment */\n    margin: '0 auto' /* center alignment */\n  }}\n/>\n</Zoom>\n"},"h3-3-configure-the-integration-in-adapty-pcfe30ac3":{"contentHash":"sha256:cfe30ac320c7021267a43494e5ed0531a5d8580eff0d8d1dfb798936ec09fe44","proseHash":"sha256:cfe30ac320c7021267a43494e5ed0531a5d8580eff0d8d1dfb798936ec09fe44","translation":"### 3\\. 在 Adapty 中配置集成 \\{#configure-the-integration-in-adapty\\}\n\n1. 前往 [**Integrations** → **Slack**](https://app.adapty.io/integrations/slack)：\n\n<Zoom>\n  <img src=\"/assets/shared/img/b4ffd71-CleanShot_2024-01-04_at_19.05.222x.webp\"\n  style={{\n    border: 'none', /* border width and color */\n    width: '700px', /* image width */\n    display: 'block', /* for alignment */\n    margin: '0 auto' /* center alignment */\n  }}\n/>\n</Zoom>\n"},"h3-3-configure-the-integration-in-adapty-p3de7b67a":{"contentHash":"sha256:3de7b67a702f4ed38a875ceb3a30b6b12dd15fb63f00586c42887b163b3f4732","proseHash":"sha256:3de7b67a702f4ed38a875ceb3a30b6b12dd15fb63f00586c42887b163b3f4732","translation":"2. 粘贴上一步中的 `xoxb-...` 令牌，并选择应用将发布到的频道。您可以将集成设置为仅接收生产环境事件、沙盒事件或两者兼收。您也可以选择发布的货币（原始货币或换算为 USD）。\n\n  :::note\n  请注意，如果您希望 Adapty 在私有频道中发布消息，您需要手动将在 Slack 中创建的 `Adapty` 应用添加到该频道，否则将无法正常使用。\n  :::\n\n3. 最后，您可以在 **Events** 下选择要接收的事件：\n"},"h3-3-configure-the-integration-in-adapty-pc7a328b6":{"contentHash":"sha256:c7a328b6abfeaeb349ec4c59e7ab819c875bf662ca66a10e79ab61d1103ee2ef","proseHash":"sha256:c7a328b6abfeaeb349ec4c59e7ab819c875bf662ca66a10e79ab61d1103ee2ef","translation":"<Zoom>\n  <img src=\"/assets/shared/img/970a7bb-CleanShot_2024-01-04_at_19.09.472x.webp\"\n  style={{\n    border: 'none', /* border width and color */\n    width: '700px', /* image width */\n    display: 'block', /* for alignment */\n    margin: '0 auto' /* center alignment */\n  }}\n/>\n</Zoom>\n\n一切就绪！\n\n事件将发送至您指定的渠道。您可以在适用的情况下查看收入，并在 Adapty 中查看用户画像：\n"},"h3-3-configure-the-integration-in-adapty-pcdace607":{"contentHash":"sha256:cdace6075fc2048a962e025e445cae06c8db26d63ccd9388025937376c8a1356","proseHash":"sha256:cdace6075fc2048a962e025e445cae06c8db26d63ccd9388025937376c8a1356","translation":"<Zoom>\n  <img src=\"/assets/shared/img/852b8c8-CleanShot_2024-01-04_at_19.11.332x.webp\"\n  style={{\n    border: 'none', /* border width and color */\n    width: '700px', /* image width */\n    display: 'block', /* for alignment */\n    margin: '0 auto' /* center alignment */\n  }}\n/>\n</Zoom>\n"},"h2-troubleshooting":{"contentHash":"sha256:ab082ac24e8895d9bf32d90891535ef59cc1bf43da0f618458302fd132a48b00","proseHash":"sha256:ab082ac24e8895d9bf32d90891535ef59cc1bf43da0f618458302fd132a48b00","translation":"## 故障排查 \\{#troubleshooting\\}\n"},"h3-accesslevelupdated-shows-as-failed-in-the-event-feed":{"contentHash":"sha256:b29227cbd661e39458e6604549a88c6692b5a38b85fc9724639e16fa6e96298b","proseHash":"sha256:b29227cbd661e39458e6604549a88c6692b5a38b85fc9724639e16fa6e96298b","translation":"### `access_level_updated` 在 Event Feed 中显示为失败 \\{#access-level-updated-shows-as-failed-in-the-event-feed\\}\n\n<AccessLevelUpdatedEventFeed />\n"}}}